  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A lightweight lipstick that has a non-drying formula for buildable color that feels like nothing on the lips.<b><br><br>Formulation Type: </b>Lipstick <br><br><b>Benefits: </b>Hydrating<br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Hyaluronic Acid: Visibly plumps and locks in moisture for long-lasting hydration. <br>- Sesame Seed Extract: Smooths and conditions lips for all-day comfort. <br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This lightweight lipstick provides buildable color that feels like nothing on the lips. The non-drying formula features hyaluronic acid to smooth and lock in moisture and sesame seed extract, so lips stay soft and comfortable all day. It's lipstick you can li</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Use one swipe for a sheer finish.<br>-Use three swipes for rich, saturated color.<br>-Add MERIT&rsquo;s Shade Slick Classics Tinted Lip Oil (sold separately) on top for a glossy finish.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Isostearyl Isostearate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Dimer Dilinoleyl Dimer Dilinoleate, Tribehenin, C10-18 Triglycerides, Synthetic Wax, Bis-Diglyceryl Polyacyladipate-2, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Wax (Helianthus Annuus Seed Cera), Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax (Cera Carnauba/Cire de Carnauba), Carica Papaya (Papaya) Fruit Extract, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Ascorbyl Palmitate, Tocopherol, Beta-Sitosterol, Squalene, Phenoxyethanol, Tropolone, Aroma (Flavor), Linalyl Acetate, Vanillin; May Contain/Peut Contenir (+/-): CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide), CI 77491 / CI 77492 / CI 77499 (Iron Oxides), CI 77742 (Manganese Violet), CI 42090 (Blue 1 Lake), CI 19140 (Yellow 5 Lake), CI 15850 (Red 7 Lake), CI 15850 (Red 6).</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A lightweight lipstick that has a non-drying formula for buildable color that feels like nothing on the lips.<b><br><br>Formulation Type: </b>Lipstick <br><br><b>Benefits: </b>Hydrating<br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Hyaluronic Acid: Visibly plumps and locks in moisture for long-lasting hydration. <br>- Sesame Seed Extract: Smooths and conditions lips for all-day comfort. <br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This lightweight lipstick provides buildable color that feels like nothing on the lips. The non-drying formula features hyaluronic acid to smooth and lock in moisture and sesame seed extract, so lips stay soft and comfortable all day. It's lipstick you can li</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Use one swipe for a sheer finish.<br>-Use three swipes for rich, saturated color.<br>-Add MERIT&rsquo;s Shade Slick Classics Tinted Lip Oil (sold separately) on top for a glossy finish.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Isostearyl Isostearate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Dimer Dilinoleyl Dimer Dilinoleate, Tribehenin, C10-18 Triglycerides, Synthetic Wax, Bis-Diglyceryl Polyacyladipate-2, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Wax (Helianthus Annuus Seed Cera), Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax (Cera Carnauba/Cire de Carnauba), Carica Papaya (Papaya) Fruit Extract, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Ascorbyl Palmitate, Tocopherol, Beta-Sitosterol, Squalene, Phenoxyethanol, Tropolone, Aroma (Flavor), Linalyl Acetate, Vanillin; May Contain/Peut Contenir (+/-): CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide), CI 77491 / CI 77492 / CI 77499 (Iron Oxides), CI 77742 (Manganese Violet), CI 42090 (Blue 1 Lake), CI 19140 (Yellow 5 Lake), CI 15850 (Red 7 Lake), CI 15850 (Red 6).</div></details>",
